Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.90,0:00:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.94,0:00:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.32,0:00:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.48,0:00:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a time known as\Nthe Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.24,0:00:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.86,0:00:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.66,0:00:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.58,0:00:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,\Nit'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.64,0:00:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.34,0:00:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raise the sails and take the helm!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.56,0:01:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.22,0:01:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That the end of the map reveals?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.98,0:01:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.80,0:01:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Till someone proves it real!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.20,0:01:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.66,0:01:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through all the trouble and times.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.56,0:01:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the heartache\Nand through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.90,0:01:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.62,0:01:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.36,0:01:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I know you'll stand by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.26,0:01:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard and bring along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.30,0:01:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.42,0:01:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.96,0:01:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.18,0:01:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.78,0:01:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wanna be my friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.14,0:01:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are, we are on a cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.40,0:01:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.05,0:01:56.93,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(727,0)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2\1a&HFF&\t(686,727,\1a&H00&)}Pearl
Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.05,0:01:56.93,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(727,0)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&}Pearl
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.64,0:01:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh right, they want to fight, too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.60,0:02:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now this will be fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.78,0:02:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay pops you promised me remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.34,0:02:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I run those pirates off\Nthen my debt to you is clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.66,0:02:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No more chores that's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.78,0:02:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no telling how much more of my
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.98,0:02:14.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,restaurants you could screw\Nup if you stick around.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.90,0:02:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah so kid you said you were going to\Nbe king of the pirates were you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.94,0:02:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can capture that ship, the Grand\NLine will be ours for the taking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.52,0:02:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No more pretending to be Marines or\Nraising the white flag of surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.56,0:02:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of our enemies will suspect that\Nwe're a threat with a ship like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.04,0:02:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that boat, it'll\Nalways be a sneak attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.58,0:02:41.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.49,0:02:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That boat would come in handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.02,0:02:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one would think that pirates were\Non such a ridiculous-looking ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.92,0:02:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, but Don,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.40,0:02:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even if we enter the Grand\NLine again using that vessel,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.46,0:02:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what if we come across someone\Nlike Haki Mihawk again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.38,0:02:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then what will we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.10,0:03:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really appreciate the input,\Nsailor. Anything else? No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.02,0:03:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think an ordinary man could\Ncut up a sailing ship like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.36,0:03:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That man probably has the\Npower of the Devil Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.14,0:03:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although those with Devil Fruit\Npowers are rare and legendary to us,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.36,0:03:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assure you they're\Ncommonplace on the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.20,0:03:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mihawk must have used some sort of strange\Npower when he sliced our ship to ribbons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.92,0:03:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we're on the Grand Line,\Nthose powers won't be special.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.78,0:03:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the Straw Hat Freak\Nwill be considered normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.10,0:03:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That old geezer Zeff sailed\Nthose seas for a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.84,0:03:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It stands to reason that he had strategies\Nfor dealing with those monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.10,0:03:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The techniques for\Nsurviving that parade of
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.80,0:03:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,weirdos must be written\Nin the old man's logbook.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.76,0:03:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Along with clues to the One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.02,0:03:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see, you're a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.44,0:04:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is get\Nthat logbook in the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.42,0:04:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we'll be able to find our\Nway to the One Piece again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.20,0:04:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hear that, boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.52,0:04:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's get to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.34,0:04:09.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The restaurant will be ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.88,0:04:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You pirate scum are gonna\Nhave to get through us first!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.22,0:04:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go to the control room and\Nopen up the fins. What? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.44,0:04:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a bad idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.12,0:04:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we do that, we'll be\Ngiving the enemy a foothold!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.76,0:04:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.20,0:04:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta do whatever it takes to\Nkeep those guys out of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.50,0:04:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they destroy the inside, then\Nthe old man will complain forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.16,0:04:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you just say something, you brat?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.80,0:04:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I said you're whiny now go yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.18,0:05:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you see that kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.48,0:05:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck's up with that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.12,0:05:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.60,0:05:13.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.72,0:05:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Grand Line is crawling\Nwith guys like these.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.82,0:05:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji, pay special attention\Nto how this one fights!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.14,0:05:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So let me get this straight: you're\Nattacking the restaurant that gave you food.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.12,0:05:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got no choice but To\Nbeat some manners into you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.12,0:05:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you want to fight on the water\Nwhere there's no place to stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.14,0:05:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh a bold move for someone like you the\NDevil Fruit has taken your ability to swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.56,0:05:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hasn't it your boy? Yeah, but now
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.90,0:06:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we have somewhere to fight him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.98,0:06:20.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.89,0:06:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.32,0:06:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My cooks and I will never\Ngive up defending this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.82,0:06:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare to die. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.82,0:06:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good plan, bringing up all\Nthat extra decking, genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.74,0:06:37.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we don't have to\Ntake the fight inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.94,0:06:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd hate to damage my future ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.08,0:06:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And make no mistake, it will be mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.16,0:06:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will never let you have the restaurant!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.08,0:06:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.14,0:06:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We mean business!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.60,0:06:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're battle cooks now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.94,0:07:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji, Mackerel Head! One,\Nthe Baratie's secret weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.06,0:07:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, if you want to live, I\Nsuggest running away now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.94,0:07:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.76,0:07:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing is so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.38,0:07:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paddle faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.66,0:07:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You paddle faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.64,0:07:19.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.68,0:07:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those guys are gonna sink\Nme too! Yeah! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.62,0:07:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.53,0:07:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get him, guys! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.45,0:07:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blow them away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.40,0:07:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.46,0:07:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.04,0:07:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep your eyes on the prize, Patty!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.12,0:07:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one counts!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.22,0:07:44.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.44,0:07:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Krieg, say your prayers!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.84,0:07:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little did you know that\Nthe Sea Restaurant Baratier
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.84,0:07:53.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,had such a powerful weapon\Njust waiting to be unleashed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.40,0:08:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.58,0:08:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did we bump into something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.90,0:08:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.80,0:08:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Don Creed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.50,0:08:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The man who will rule the oceans!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.76,0:08:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no you're not! I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.64,0:08:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for these stupid games!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.50,0:08:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.48,0:08:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.74,0:08:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's so strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.52,0:08:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's coming straight for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.16,0:08:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The restaurant! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.42,0:08:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Salute!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.24,0:08:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.24,0:09:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got legs of steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.46,0:09:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He kicked back that crazy\Nboat just like it was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.88,0:09:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.84,0:09:18.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice kick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.32,0:09:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.78,0:09:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to crush your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.94,0:09:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.85,0:09:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't "yeah" us, you crazy fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.42,0:09:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop acting so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.34,0:09:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't be so smug if we'd\Nbeen killed, you bucket of backwash!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.64,0:09:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.84,0:09:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you could wrap\Nthis up another time?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.54,0:09:41.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have business to attend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.22,0:09:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.58,0:09:53.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys still don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.32,0:09:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even well-armed, you're still just cooks,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.04,0:09:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we're expert fighters that\Nare way out of your league.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.40,0:10:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why don't you be good little cooks\Nand run along to a safer restaurant,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.24,0:10:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,maybe one on land, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.66,0:10:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.72,0:10:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you letting them\Nbeat you up so easily, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.12,0:10:08.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you still call\Nyourselves fighting cucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.04,0:10:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, these pirates are really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.88,0:10:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're totally different from\Nthe ones we fought before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.48,0:10:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's insulting to lump us in\Nwith that average riffraff.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.10,0:10:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are the Great Creek Pirates, and we're\Nthe absolute rulers of the East Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.22,0:10:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let it be known to all that\Nthis garish boat already
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.34,0:10:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,belongs to the great and\Npowerful Creek Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.40,0:10:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.31,0:10:29.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been a cook all my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.88,0:10:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've worked at a lot of\Nrestaurants and gotten
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.88,0:10:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fired from them all for\Nscuffling and living hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.16,0:10:38.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And after years of wondering,\Nwe finally found a home here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.12,0:10:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anybody here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.68,0:10:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the restaurant that's owned\Nby a guy named Redfoot Zef, right?
