Dialogue: 3,0:10:41.75,0:10:48.38,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(511.13,468.35)\org(511.66,435.29)\fscx33.02\fscy33.39\frz9.06\fry-7.333\frx3.792\fax0.016\fnKids\b0\bord0\c&H382E46&\4a&HFF&\blur0.9}Help\N Wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.46,0:10:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, we found this damn\NCook's Wanted sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.76,0:10:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it true?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.78,0:10:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.52,0:10:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you need to understand that\Nthis is no ordinary restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.82,0:11:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It really doesn't matter who\Nthey are or where they come from.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.66,0:11:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If someone comes in hungry, we will\Nfeed them until they're stuffed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.68,0:11:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do I make myself clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.78,0:11:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you handle that? Sir!
