Dialogue: 3,0:11:11.65,0:11:11.90,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(511.13,468.35)\org(511.66,435.29)\fscx33.02\fscy33.39\frz9.06\fry-7.333\frx3.792\fax0.016\fnKids\b0\bord0\c&H382E46&\4a&HFF&\blur0.9}Help\N Wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.86,0:11:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't serve anyone's slap like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.50,0:11:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what'd you go and hit me for, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.40,0:11:25.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure victory, sure defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.90,0:11:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We like fighting and cooking, so this\Nplace is perfect for us. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.64,0:11:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no other place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.76,0:11:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.88,0:11:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's true fighting spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.46,0:11:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Committing ourselves to cooking fine cuisine\Nday in and day out is a fierce battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.68,0:11:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compared to that, these\Npirates are nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.28,0:11:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right, yeah. Let's fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.44,0:11:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Protect Zeff!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.64,0:11:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Protect the respawn!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.08,0:12:04.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.99,0:12:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.54,0:12:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what do you guys think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.78,0:12:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:19.93,0:12:27.85,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(474,0)\an8\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,90)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(433,474,\1a&H00&)}Pearl "the Invincible"\NSecond Unit Commander\NKrieg Pirates
Dialogue: 2,0:12:19.93,0:12:27.85,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(474,0)\an8\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,90)\3c&HE7E7E7&\c&HE7E7E7&\1a&HFF&\t(433,474,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Pearl "the Invincible"\NSecond Unit Commander\NKrieg Pirates
Dialogue: 3,0:12:19.93,0:12:27.85,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(474,0)\an8\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,90)\c&HE7E7E7&\4a&HFF&}Pearl "the Invincible"\NSecond Unit Commander\NKrieg Pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.92,0:12:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.82,0:12:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But before we begin, it's only fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.70,0:12:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I give you a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.76,0:12:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Pearl the Invincible Shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.24,0:12:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Pearl Perona Carne!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.50,0:12:34.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.41,0:12:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'd say that pair is far from okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.16,0:12:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two just experienced\Nmy Pearl Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.46,0:12:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of my signature punches!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.72,0:12:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bumbling, pathetic
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.70,0:12:44.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.61,0:12:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.68,0:12:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice knife!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.06,0:12:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'll take it! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.96,0:12:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.30,0:12:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on! Let it go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.84,0:12:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said, give it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.58,0:13:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.54,0:13:07.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guy
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.45,0:13:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,knows how to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.37,0:13:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kick some serious butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.28,0:13:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A kitchen knife is a\Ncook's soul! How dare?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.50,0:13:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you filthy pirates trying to\Ndesecrate one with your grubby little hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.80,0:13:16.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.10,0:13:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just stay down and hang on to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.96,0:13:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna teach these bozos a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.48,0:13:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be out of your mind if you think\Nwe're gonna be beaten by a mere cook!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.94,0:13:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll show you mere cook after I\Nfillet every one of you bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.10,0:13:39.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.01,0:13:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How very impudent of you to defeat\Nthem all using only your kicks,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.90,0:13:44.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,am I to be impressed by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.00,0:13:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a cook, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.80,0:13:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't do my job very well\Nif I ruined my hands in battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.32,0:13:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I'll be taking you down with my feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.02,0:13:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.30,0:13:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.64,0:13:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm invincible, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.24,0:14:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've won all 61 of my battles\Ncompletely and totally unscathed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.40,0:14:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's quite remarkable, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.18,0:14:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one has ever shed a single drop\Nof my blood in battle. No one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.56,0:14:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now do you realize my power?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.06,0:14:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may be a gentleman, but I'm not gentle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.36,0:14:17.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.78,0:14:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that supposed to be a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.78,0:14:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because it wasn't even a little bit funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.60,0:14:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dropping your gun is a good\Nway to end up dead, you brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.02,0:14:34.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even battleship cannons don't work on me.

